   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law, in relation to authorizing the city of Olean to\nimpose a hotel and motel tax",
    "basePrintNo": "S6671",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6671-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §1202-uu, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S6671\n\nSPONSOR: BORRELLO\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the tax law, in relation to authorizing the city of\nOlean to impose a hotel and motel tax\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo authorize the city of Olean to impose a five percent hotel and motel\ntax.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: the tax law is amended by adding section 1202-uu\n\nSection 2: Effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe city of Olean has requested the ability to tax hotel, motel, bed and\nbreakfast and Airbnb rates to assist with their fund balance and contin-\nue to promote the general financial well-being of the community.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "printNo": "S6671",
    "publishDate": "2023-05-04",
